    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（大欠伸しちゃった。んん、近ごろ寝不足だなぁ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（仕方ないよね、部活も二年生になってからコンクールとかにどんどん出品するようになって大忙しだし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（『彼』が帰ってきてから、毎日ドタバタ騒ぎだもん）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ちょっぴり、疲れちゃうけど。楽しいなぁ、えへへ。もうじき晩ご飯だよね、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（食べたらすぐ寝ちゃおっかな。いろいろ制作も一段落して、急ぎの〆切もないし～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（あぁでも、ゆきちゃんに新作を頼まれてたんだっけ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（前につくってあげたゴスロリ、すっごく喜んでくれたなぁ……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ゆきちゃん、いつもは澄まし顔っていうか無表情だから。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（笑うと、びっくりするほどキュートなんだよね。また見たいなぁ、あの笑顔……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（次は、どんなのつくろうかな。前回は衣装づくりなんて初めてだったから、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（いっぱいいっぱいになっちゃって……。普通のやつ、仕上げるのが精一杯だったし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（次は、ゆきちゃんの意見をもうちょっと採り入れたいなぁ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（う～ん、でもいまだに彼を通してメールとかのやりとりしてるからなぁ。ゆきちゃんの、連絡先も知らないし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（学校だと、ゆきちゃんに声かけると恥ずかしがって逃げちゃうしなぁ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（まだるっこしいし、今さらだけど……。彼に、ゆきちゃんの電話番号とか教えてもらおうかな？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ゆきちゃんと彼の秘密の関係に横入りしちゃうみたいで、ちょっと気が咎めるけど……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（いいよね、いいんだもん。うん、そうしよう）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「お～い！　ちょっといい？　なつみだよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（えへへ。家が『おとなりさん』だと、こういうとき便利だなぁ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（電話かけるより直接、窓越しに呼びかけたほうが早いもんね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（登校中とか教室とかでも、いくらでも会えるけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（善は急げだよね、うんうん）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ん～、返事がない？　部屋の明かりはついてるし、もう帰ってるんだと思うけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（窓も開いてるよね、声も届いてるはずだけどなぁ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（音楽を聞いてるとか、それともテレビでも見てるのかな？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（いや、誰かきてるっぽい？　どうも、彼の部屋から声がするような？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（お客さんなら、邪魔しちゃ駄目だよね……んん？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（あれ、彼ったらふつうに部屋にいる。他には、誰もいなさそうだけど……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（んもう、いるなら返事ぐらいしてくれてもいいのに～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（何やってるんだろう、ひとりで床に座りこんで……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（う～ん、彼がこっちに背中を向けてるからびみょうに見にくいけど……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（何かを、手に握りしめてる？　お人形、みたいなのを？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ん、んん？　いやうん、大丈夫！　わたし、理解のある幼なじみだから！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（そういう趣味もあるよねっ、むかしよく一緒に『お人形さん遊び』したもんねっ♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（わっとと？　あっぶない、窓から身を乗りだしすぎて落ちそうになった!?）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（見てるのばれたら気まずいし、もっと慎重に……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（んん？　今どきのお人形って、よくできてるんだなぁ？　ほんとに、人間をそのまんま縮めたみたいな……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ていうか。あのお人形、何かに似てるなぁ？　髪の色といい、体型といい……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（あぁ……そうだ、ゆきちゃんに『そっくり』なんだ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（んんん～？　ご、ごめんアウト！　それはちょっと、さすがにアウトかなぁっ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ごめんね、心の狭い幼なじみでごめんね！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（でもね、知りあいの女の子に『そっくり』のお人形さんを調達して……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（仲良くお喋りするとか、ちょっと倒錯的すぎるかなぁ～っ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ごめんね、幼なじみとして見過ごせない！　止めるっていうか、お説教するね！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（ゆるしてねっ、でもこれは愛なの！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（安心してっ、わたしが思いださせてあげる！　人間の、生身の女の子の『ぬくもり』を！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（待っててっ、いま行くからね！　わたしが、君を助けてあげる……！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「……わひゃっ!?　な、なぁにお母さん？　晩ご飯？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「今はそんなのどうでもいいっ、彼がお人形さんしか愛せなくなる前に止めなくちゃ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あ痛っ、フライパンで叩かないで！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ごめんねお母さん、そうだね！　晩ご飯を『どうでもいい』とか言っちゃ駄目だよねっ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたし悪い子！　鬼の形相しないで～っ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「反省したから、晩ご飯抜きだけは勘弁して～！　近ごろ、やたらお腹がすくの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ほぇ？　う、うん！　そっか、彼のおうち……またご両親が出張中なんだ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あんずさんも、いないの？　ふぅん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「だから、彼をお夕飯に誘っておいでって？　わ、わかった！　急いで行ってくるねっ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「他にも用件もあるし！　彼のこと、みっちりお説教しなくちゃ……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「えっ、そう？　最近は毎日、楽しそうって？　そうかなぁっ？　わかんない！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まぁ、彼のせいでね？　ほんと、だいたいいつも彼のせいだよね！」"
